This directory is for files which are under development and which
we wish to track for reference, but they aren't ready to be placed
into production in the standard flat/ and bias/ directories.

pixflatave-*-56055.fits.gz:
Generated from lossy fiber test data on MJD 56055 exps 143494-143553 (sp1)
and MJD 56056 exps 143560-143619 (sp2).  They slightly differ from
the previous versions, but are not distinctly better.

--> they do *not* have the extra masked regions added by hand, and
    thus they cannot be used as-is.


